# Deploy = publish + push

When the user says **deploy**, **ship**, or **publish** for guru/`windguru`:

1. Commit if there are uncommitted release changes (only if they asked to commit/deploy).
2. Build and upload to PyPI.
3. **Also `git push origin HEAD`** — do not leave `main` ahead of `origin`.
4. Reinstall locally (`pipx install --force` / upgrade) so this PC matches PyPI.

Do not ask separately for push permission when they already said deploy/ship/publish.
